// Refined tracer case: 0.5 mm X/Y cells, dt=0.025 s.
// Inlet probes are centres of the 20 refined inlet-adjacent cells.
// Diffusive inlet supply: sum(DT * 5e-7 * (1-Tcell) / 0.00025).
